  "summary": "My lovely wife Mechelle and I were married at the Carneros Inn in Napa, CA on June 25th, 2006.\n\nWe were honored by all the family and friends who came to Napa to participate in our wedding. Napa of course provided the perfect setting, and the Carneros Inn is one of our favorite spots to stay whenever we visit Napa. I can honestly say that these were the best days of my life.",
